**Assessment Program:**
- **Annual Assessment:** Comprehensive NIST SP 800-171A assessment of all 110 CMMC Level 2 practices using examine, interview, and test methods
- **Continuous Monitoring:** Automated control effectiveness measurement via Evidence Ops assessment toolchain
- **Third-Party Assessment:** C3PAO assessment engagement per CMMC certification requirements
- **Triggered Assessments:** Re-assessment upon significant system changes, security incidents, or new threat intelligence

**Assessment Artifacts:**
- Security Assessment Report (SAR) documenting control effectiveness findings
- POA&M for deficient controls with remediation milestones
- SPRS score calculation and submission to SPRS portal

**Operational Procedure:**
- **Action:** Annual security assessment; quarterly Secure Score review; continuous automated monitoring
- **Frequency:** Annual comprehensive, quarterly metric review, continuous automation
- **Responsible Party:** {{variables.systemAdministrator}}
- **Documentation:** Security Assessment Plan v1.0, Assessment Report Template

**Review Frequency:** Quarterly by ISSO

**Verification Method:** Examine security assessment reports, Secure Score trends, POA&M entries, SPRS submission records, and assessment plan update history.

